<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 151 0 R
/E (Undress Code is not a brand that is still finding its footing. It is a brand that has arrived somewhere significant: 187,000 followers, a blue verification badge, distribution at Harrods, Galeries Lafayette, KaDeWe, Illum, Breuninger, and Revolve, press coverage in Vogue and Elle across Europe and Asia, and organic celebrity wear from figures at the scale of Taylor Swift.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [9]
>>
