222 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 151 0 R
/E (What this audit addresses is the next threshold: the moment when instinctive brand-building must become intentional brand architecture. Not a correction of what exists, but a reading of where the brand is already going, and a proposal for how to get there faster, with more clarity and more consistency.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [14]
>>
endobj
223 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 151 0 R
/E (The brand's philosophy centres on one statement: made for women who write their own stories. Everything else \(the no-overproduction commitment, the in-house Warsaw design, the plastic-free packaging, the range that moves freely between lingerie, ready-to-wear, bodysuits, loungewear, and swimwear\) flows from this positioning. It is a premium-to-luxury brand by distribution and by product. The communication must now earn that same positioning on every platform it occupies.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [15]
>>
endobj
