/E (The gap between a typical post and the top performer is not incremental: it is structural. Posts that reach 871 or 1,441 likes do not simply have better images. They have a different relationship between image, caption, and audience expectation. Identifying what that relationship is and building it into a repeatable logic is where the highest leverage exists.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [19]
>>
