/P 155 0 R
/T (Red appears in concentrated clusters across the feed: the long red dress at the market, the close-up of tomatoes, the red slip skirt, the red one-shoulder dress. Black anchors the majority of the feed. The monochrome dot pattern recurs with notable frequency. This is not a random palette: it is an emerging system that the brand is already using intuitively. Formalising it would give the feed a recognisable visual rhythm that rewards the returning viewer.)
